AI-assisted development
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parts of this software's interface and tooling were developed with the
assistance of AI coding tools, in combination with significant human design,
iteration, and domain expertise. We have made reasonable efforts to ensure
that AI-generated contributions do not infringe third-party copyrights. If
you believe any part of this software infringes your copyright, please contact
matthias.meschede@quantstack.net immediately and we will address the matter
promptly.

